OL,3,GNEWSAAlcohol licence rejected after
OL,4,Apolice objection
OL,5,
OL,6,FA shisha bar has had its alcohol
OL,7,Flicence application rejected after
OL,8,Fpolice lodged an objection.
OL,10,FThe owner of Diamond Shisha Lounge in
OL,11,FCanterbury had applied to sell alcohol
OL,12,Ffrom 12:00 to 23:00 every day to boost
OL,13,Fthe struggling business.
OL,15,FCanterbury City Council threw out the
OL,16,Fplans following Kent Police's
OL,17,Fsubmission, which included images
OL,18,Fappearing to show shisha pipes near a
OL,19,Fdisused toilet covered in cling film.
OL,23,APub: 27-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
