OL,3,GNEWSAAlcohol licence rejected after
OL,4,Apolice objection
OL,5,
OL,6,FAccording to the Local Democracy
OL,7,FReporting Service (LDRS), the lounge's
OL,8,Fowner, Daniel Sbhatlab, said the site
OL,9,Fhad been cleaned since, adding: "It's
OL,10,Fclean now, it's not like before now I
OL,11,Fchanged everything. I refreshed the
OL,12,Fplace."
